en. Insgesamt wird\ndamit nur ein Teil der Strahlung absorbiert. Daher erw\u00e4rmen sich\nOberfl\u00e4chen, welche gut reflektieren k\u00f6nnen, auch weniger.","fontSize":6.723916968649631,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"6I3HNFtWtIGWF1b1BqBX1","originalText":"\nNeben der Absorption gibt es auch die Reflexion. Bei der Reflexion werden die Sonnenstrahlen wieder zur\u00fcckgeworfen. Insgesamt wird damit nur ein Teil der Strahlung absorbiert. Daher erw\u00e4rmen sich Oberfl\u00e4chen, welche gut reflektieren k\u00f6nnen, auch weniger.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null,"baseFontSize":null},{"id":"rV1BPRpAPhe9fqe4OTr_2","type":"image","x":543.3883951571598,"y":-1092.6586225428384,"width":184.9764800183934,"height":100.83787278780474,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"transparent","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["5LbfxZ_BimXsf163iWGPT","YefOMLwO-GPGd4F5kluOL"],"frameId":null,"index":"b7i","roundness":null,"seed":1912150523,"version":376,"versionNonce":185961429,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1793278114785,"created":1793276650886,"link":null,"locked":false,"status":"saved","fileId":"1fc3ff2ede985d0e642340442b6610c8e9b8339b","scale":[1,1],"crop":null},{"id":"GjeekZVAxi6I0-mmrui-P","type":"text","x":544.9042737374496,"y":-979.4758916914825,"width":182.80464042121173,"height":6.059216482458725,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#fdc89d","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["Rp38WWbH780ddQtX5MUOV","zduCPHsvVAyeKOM5Vq4vP","X9AVvC8l8jRcMHRAgAkNe","POSU20DAZEhAKMRkMDlXd","5LbfxZ_BimXsf163iWGPT","YefOMLwO-GPGd4F5kluOL"],"frameId":null,"index":"b7iV","roundness":null,"seed":1661508405,"version":1759,"versionNonce":53645617,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1794399936926,"created":1793276683167,"link":null,"locked":false,"text